title: "Gist Graph"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/dhrrishitvdeka/gistgraph"
url: "https://github.com/dhrrishitvdeka/gistgraph"
abstract: >-
  Gist Graph compresses a long text context into a small sparse latent graph that a frozen
  language model reads as a soft prompt. It routes text segments into latent nodes, induces typed
  edges between them without a parser, passes messages over the graph, and is trained by
  distilling the model's answers given the full context.
keywords:
  - context compression
  - soft prompts
  - latent graphs
  - long context
authors:
